# Local/secrets and quarantined artifacts
00-audit/quarantine/
**/*.REVIEW-EXCLUDED
**/config.txt
**/accounts.json
**/*secret*
**/*.key
**/*.bin

# Python generated/runtime artifacts
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd

# Logs / local runtime state
**/*.log

# Extracted executables / packaged runtime
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
